+  /* ---- skellycam patch 0001: raw payload-header timing (appended; prefix layout unchanged) ----
+   * All host_* values are CLOCK_MONOTONIC in ns (QPC on the Windows compat shim). They are
+   * taken when the libusb transfer that carried the payload completed, i.e. after its last
+   * isochronous packet; *_packet_idx and packets_per_transfer let you back-date to the
